    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:altLabel "Overstorey" ;
    skos:definition "Dominant stratum comprises of very tall mid-dense trees (above 21m), with a crown cover of 67% and crown separation ratio of 0.1."@en ;
    skos:historyNote "Added this collection based on the Third Edition of the 'Yellow Book' (Australian soil and land survey field handbook)" ;
